              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M9 4.5a.75.75 0 01.721.544l.813 2.846a3.75 3.75 0 002.576 2.576l2.846.813a.75.75 0 010 1.442l-2.846.813a3.75 3.75 0 00-2.576 2.576l-.813 2.846a.75.75 0 01-1.442 0l-.813-2.846a3.75 3.75 0 00-2.576-2.576l-2.846-.813a.75.75 0 010-1.442l2.846-.813A3.75 3.75 0 007.466 7.89l.813-2.846A.75.75 0 019 4.5zM18 1.5a.75.75 0 01.728.568l.258 1.036c.236.94.97 1.674 1.91 1.91l1.036.258a.75.75 0 010 1.456l-1.036.258c-.94.236-1.674.97-1.91 1.91l-.258 1.036a.75.75 0 01-1.456 0l-.258-1.036a2.625 2.625 0 00-1.91-1.91l-1.036-.258a.75.75 0 010-1.456l1.036-.258a2.625 2.625 0 001.91-1.91l.258-1.036A.75.75 0 0118 1.5z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
              </svg>
              Tecnología de Vanguardia
            </div>
            
            <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-mocha leading-tight">
              Descubre el poder de <span class="text-terracotta">Ultraformer MPT</span>
            </h2>
            
            <p class="text-lg text-taupe leading-relaxed">
              Experimenta el lifting no quirúrgico más avanzado en nuestra clínica. <strong>Ultraformer MPT (Micro Pulsed Technology)</strong> revoluciona el tratamiento con ultrasonido focalizado (HIFU), logrando tensar, levantar y contornear la piel con sesiones más rápidas y con un nivel de confort significativamente mayor.
            </p>
            
            <ul class="space-y-4 pt-2">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
                <div class="mt-1 flex h-8 w-8 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-champagne/20 text-champagne">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="h-4 w-4"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5" /></svg>
                </div>
                <div>
