              <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
                <div class="mt-1 flex h-8 w-8 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-champagne/20 text-champagne">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="h-4 w-4"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5" /></svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <p class="font-semibold text-mocha">Efecto Lifting Potenciado</p>
                  <p class="text-sm text-taupe mt-0.5">Mayor acumulación de energía térmica que maximiza la producción de colágeno y el tensado de la piel.</p>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
                <div class="mt-1 flex h-8 w-8 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-champagne/20 text-champagne">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="h-4 w-4"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5" /></svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <p class="font-semibold text-mocha">Personalización total</p>
                  <p class="text-sm text-taupe mt-0.5">Transductores circulares exclusivos para áreas difíciles y resultados precisos en rostro, papada y cuerpo.</p>
                </div>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          
          <div class="order-1 md:order-2 relative h-[450px] md:h-[600px] w-full rounded-luxury overflow-hidden shadow-2xl shadow-mocha/10 group">
            <img 
              src="/images/ultraformer2.jpg" 
              alt="Tratamiento Ultraformer MPT" 
              class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-[10s] group-hover:scale-105" 
            />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-mocha/80 via-mocha/20 to-transparent"></div>
            
            <div class="absolute bottom-8 left-8 right-8">
              <div class="rounded-2xl bg-pure/90 p-5 backdrop-blur-md shadow-lg transform transition group-hover:-translate-y-2">
                <p class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-mocha">Ultraformer MPT</p>
